    "title": "Kikuchi Craft Bubble Swimmer",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The bubble swimmer  is a renowned lure in offshore big game fishing, especially tuna casting. <br />Its centrally concentrated weight balance provides exceptional casting distance, allowing anglers to approach promising targets at great distances. <br />Proven effective in countless fields both domestically and internationally, including the magnificent bluefin tuna of Oma, it has established itself as a pioneer in the recent popper boom in tuna casting.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The basic action of the BUBBLE SWIMMER is &quot;stop and go.&quot; <br />It breaks the water's surface, moving with small bubbles, and then instantly comes to a stop. This contrast between movement and stillness is the key to awakening the hunting instincts of the target fish. <br />In particular, the long pauses provide an effective approach for wary big game fish. To maximize its potential, we recommend pairing it with a rod that has a flexible tip.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length </span>210 mm</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Gr.71</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Color Sardine</p></li></ul><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length </span>240 mm</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Gr.106</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Color Sardine</p></li></ul>",
